# <name>.spool

A shared Millstrand spool.

## Prerequisites

Approve this spool and each prerequisite explicitly in the operator workspace.

## Dependency information

Pin this repository and its prerequisites in `.millstrand/spools.edn` or
`.ms/spools.edn`; exactly one of `.millstrand` or `.ms` may be present. For the
authoritative receipt-selection rule, see [Dresser's Receipt, plan, verify, and
stamp contract](https://github.com/codethread/dresser.spool/blob/main/dresser.md#receipt-plan-verify-and-stamp).

## Activation

After approval, sync the operator runtime and activate `ct.spools.<name>`.

## Development

Local tests require an immutable Millstrand checkout at sibling `../millstrand` because the test alias uses `../millstrand/spools/workflow/src`; CI creates that layout.
